     -       (BesselI(1,R/l)*BesselK(0,(L + R)/l) + BesselI(0,(L + \
R)/l)*BesselK(1,R/l))))/
     -  (B*l*(BesselI(0,(L + R)/l)*BesselK(0,R/l) - \
BesselI(0,R/l)*BesselK(0,(L + R)/l)))\
\>", "Output",
